## Persistence and implementation notes
`data.js` is the source for mission and crew tuning. Save data uses browser-local `localStorage`; it is not uploaded, shared across players, or synced to an account. The captain and career are preserved when loading in the same browser profile, while Restart Career clears progress and restores the original roster. Active missions do not resume after closing the game. The mission simulation is an abstraction: supplies, crew health/morale, events and fuel are modeled per turn, not solved with a physical trajectory engine. Sprite sheets are JPEGs with white backgrounds; `sprites.js` removes connected background pixels, crops each grid cell and draws characters without stretching.

